<title>USA: Merchants Group Inc Q4 net loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Merchants Group Inc Q4 net loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>BUFFALO, N.Y. 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $1.05   profit	 $0.30</p>
<p> Net loss		   3,262   profit	   982</p>
<p> Revs			27,117		   27,073</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   3,101		    3,220</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.36     loss	 $1.19</p>
<p> Revs loss		  1,148     loss	 3,819</p>
<p> Revs		     108,644	   104,544</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   3,182		    3,219</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 loss mostly due to increase in estimate to settle pre-1995 workers' compensation claims; an increase in current-year workers' compensation reserves; and an increase in other current-year business reserve due to large losses on the company's business owners and general liability policies.</p>
</text>
